1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,063
This guide is for team members who were given access to programs, polls or businesses.

2
00:00:06,663 --> 00:00:13,156
A program admin can manage only the items they were given. A viewer can only look at
them.

3
00:00:13,756 --> 00:00:21,574
A program admin cannot agree to the platform fee or make refunds. Those belong to an
organization admin.

4
00:00:22,174 --> 00:00:31,597
You can start a space of your own, where you are the admin, without losing the access
you were invited to, and you can leave an organization at any time.

5
00:00:32,197 --> 00:00:38,125
NTSOne. One platform. Endless possibilities.
